{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle for Rakir</strong> is an open-world, isometric (top-down) space combat game. This\u00a0RPG is set in orbit around the war-torn desert colony of Rakir.\u00a0Rakir,\u00a0once a slave world, has risen in rebellion against its master, the tyrannical Federation; a galactic power that exploits its colonies for profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a new recruit in Rakir\u2019s amateur spy division, you\u2019ll pilot advanced spacecraft, command small strike fleets, and carry out daring missions to sabotage the Federation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planned gameplay loop is to level up your pilot, customize your build with hundreds of abilities, and make key decisions in a branching campaign that shapes the fate of the rebellion.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a solo indie project. Please help me to make it better, with your suggestions and by reporting any game breaking bugs.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3355420?t=1764709265","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355420/923d01cae3b0fbb4591b046fd03a0b89fa1692b4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764709265","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355420/f6675f61619b819b59f2f670a0d8fdd7c404cd2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764709265","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355420/f6675f61619b819b59f2f670a0d8fdd7c404cd2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764709265","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Violence: Violence is depicted via the destruction of fantasy spaceships, and character's dialogue reactions to them.\r\n\r\nSexual Content: Some sexual content is suggested via text based dialogue, but it is sparse and nothing is shown or described in any detail."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle for Rakir</strong> is an open-world, isometric (top-down) space combat game. This\u00a0RPG is set in orbit around the war-torn desert colony of Rakir.\u00a0Rakir,\u00a0once a slave world, has risen in rebellion against its master, the tyrannical Federation; a galactic power that exploits its colonies for profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a new recruit in Rakir\u2019s amateur spy division, you\u2019ll pilot advanced spacecraft, command small strike fleets, and carry out daring missions to sabotage the Federation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planned gameplay loop is to level up your pilot, customize your build with hundreds of abilities, and make key decisions in a branching campaign that shapes the fate of the rebellion.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a solo indie project. Please help me to make it better, with your suggestions and by reporting any game breaking bugs.</p>","developers":["Tyler Loeper"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355420/header.jpg?t=1764709265","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 15.10 and later.<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any Processors after 2015<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any graphics card released after 2015, or modern integrated graphics cards.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 15 Sequoia<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 64-bit + Apple silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any modern graphics card released after 2015.<br></l